{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"sparql","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"SPARQL","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for SPARQL (.rq .sparql .sq).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"sparql","name":"SPARQL","extensions":[".rq",".sparql",".sq"],"grammar":"grammars/sparql.json","lineComment":"#"}],"snippets":[{"language":"SPARQL","path":"snippets/sparql.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/sparql.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": true,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[?$][A-Za-z_]\\\\w*\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"<[^<>\\\"\\\\s{}|\\\\\\\\^`]*>\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[A-Za-z_][\\\\w-]*:[A-Za-z_][\\\\w.-]*|\\\\b[A-Za-z_][\\\\w-]*:(?=\\\\s)\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:CONSTRUCT|DESCRIBE|DISTINCT|OPTIONAL|REDUCED|SERVICE|SELECT|PREFIX|OFFSET|HAVING|FILTER|VALUES|EXISTS|SILENT|INSERT|DELETE|WHERE|NAMED|ORDER|LIMIT|GROUP|UNION|MINUS|GRAPH|USING|FROM|BASE|DESC|BIND|DATA|WITH|ASK|ASC|NOT|BY|AS|IN|a)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:GROUP_CONCAT|STRSTARTS|DATATYPE|CONTAINS|COALESCE|STRENDS|REPLACE|CONCAT|STRLEN|SUBSTR|SAMPLE|BOUND|BNODE|FLOOR|ROUND|UCASE|LCASE|REGEX|COUNT|MONTH|LANG|RAND|CEIL|YEAR|STR|IRI|URI|ABS|SUM|MIN|MAX|AVG|NOW|DAY|IF)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/sparql.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Select\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sel\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\",\n      \"\",\n      \"SELECT ${1:?s ?label}\",\n      \"WHERE {\",\n      \"  ${2:?s} rdfs:label ${3:?label} .\",\n      \"}\",\n      \"LIMIT ${4:10}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"SELECT query\"\n  },\n  \"Filter\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"filter\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"FILTER (${1:?x} ${2:>} ${3:0})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"FILTER\"\n  },\n  \"Optional\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"opt\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"OPTIONAL { ${1:?s ?p ?o} . }\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"OPTIONAL\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# SPARQL\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for SPARQL.\n\n## Files\n\n`.rq`, `.sparql`, `.sq`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `sel` | SELECT query |\n| `filter` | FILTER |\n| `opt` | OPTIONAL |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}